A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4798b4fc\" id=\"u4798b4fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a68c87f\" id=\"u4a68c87f\">✅</span><span data-lake-id=\"ufb277335\" id=\"ufb277335\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u002e82b6\" id=\"u002e82b6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: #000000\">独立使用时：</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub12bef59\" id=\"ub12bef59\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">a++;  等同于 a = a + 1;  等同于 ++a;  等同于 a+=1；</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SRERx%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"YUZlv\" id=\"YUZlv\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufa1cb7d4\" id=\"ufa1cb7d4\">2&gt; a++和++a 应用于表达式时不同</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22a%2B%2B%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctint%20a%2C%20b%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Cta%20%3D%201%3B%5Cn%5Ctb%20%3D%20a%2B%2B%3B%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E7%AD%89%E5%90%8C%E4%BA%8E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20b%20%3D%20a%20%3B%5Ct%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%2F%2F%20a%20%3D%20a%20%2B%201%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22a%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20a)%3B%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22b%20%3D%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20b)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22a%2B%2B%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OWbzE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud750730a\" id=\"ud750730a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3d58a0bf\" id=\"u3d58a0bf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">后++，先赋值